# --- Model artifacts --------------------------------------------------------
# Anchored to the repository root on purpose. An unanchored `models/` also matches
# `src/shingan/models/`, which silently kept the entire model layer out of git: every
# clone failed with `ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'shingan.models'` while local
# runs, which read the working tree, passed. The other names below (`runs/`, `outputs/`,
# `checkpoints/`) are equally generic and are anchored for the same reason. Anything
# produced at runtime belongs under `artifacts/`, which is rooted here too.
/artifacts/
/models/
/checkpoints/
/outputs/
/wandb/
/mlruns/
/runs/
*.ckpt
*.pt
*.pth
*.bin
*.safetensors
*.gguf
*.onnx
*.joblib
*.pkl
adapter_model.*
optimizer.pt
scheduler.pt
training_args.bin
rng_state.pth

# --- Hugging Face caches ----------------------------------------------------
.cache/
.hf_cache/
huggingface/
transformers_cache/
datasets_cache/

