# --- Internal design notes (never published) --------------------------------
# The original `lora-1.md` .. `lora-5.md` discussion notes are the working record of the
# design conversation that preceded this project. They are not specification, and the
# specification does not depend on them: every document under `docs/` is self-contained
# and cites nothing from here. Ignored so that a checkout of this repository exposes the
# official setup and files only.
docs/discussion/

# Tool-local working directory (design log, caches). Not part of the published project:
# the memory log records the debugging history, which is process rather than specification.
# Remove this line if the memory or automation files in here should be versioned after all.
.workbuddy/

# --- Scratch ----------------------------------------------------------------
scratch/
tmp/
temp/
*.tmp
